---
description: Error and logging conventions
globs: ["**/*.py"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Raise platform_kit errors (NotFoundError, ConflictError, ...) or subclasses; never HTTPException, never `except: pass`.
- `message` is shown to end users (no internals). `detail=` and kwargs are for developers/logs.
- `log.info("snake_case_event", key=value)`: no f-strings in log messages, no print, no logging.getLogger, no os.environ.
